OL,3,GNEWSASurrey museums complete
OL,4,Aaccessibility project
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree museums in Surrey have celebrated
OL,7,Fthe completion of a project to improve
OL,8,Faccessibility for disabled visitors.
OL,10,FThe Rural Life Living Museum, Guildford
OL,11,FMuseum and East Surrey Museum are now
OL,12,Feven more inclusive, said the Surrey
OL,13,FCoalition of Disabled People, which
OL,14,Fhelped deliver the scheme.
OL,16,FMark Wiles, chair of East Surrey Museum
OL,17,Fin Caterham, said that the project had
OL,18,Flooked at "simple things" which could
OL,19,Fbe improved.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
